{"id":"bd6b982556489ede","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution.md","title":"Numeral Instances in the Book’s Syntax","display":"df-smullyan-numeral-substitution — Numeral Instances in the Book’s Syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution","aliases":["92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution"],"display":"df-smullyan-numeral-substitution — Numeral Instances in the Book’s Syntax","source":"第 II 章 p. 16（PDF 33）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-smullyan-numeral-substitution — Numeral Instances in the Book’s Syntax"},{"key":"source","html":"第 II 章 p. 16（PDF 33）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"72f7b5109e33fa0f\" href=\"?note=72f7b5109e33fa0f\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-free-variables\">92-df-smullyan-free-variables</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\geq1,n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(i\\geq1,n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t,s\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E\">\\(t,s\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E\">\\(F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E\\)</span>，原书构造器与变量集见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"72f7b5109e33fa0f\" href=\"?note=72f7b5109e33fa0f\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-free-variables\">92-df-smullyan-free-variables</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}\">\\(\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}\\)</span> 分别为项、公式的数码代入函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(\\nu_m^E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu_m^E,&amp;\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(v_j^E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\nu_n^E&amp;j=i,\\\\v_j^E&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t)&#39;,\\\\\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(s),\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,t))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{rel}_E(\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(s),\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t))\\quad(\\operatorname{rel}\\in\\{\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{le}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\neg_E F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)\\supset\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\forall v_j^E F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v_j^E F&amp;j=i,\\\\\\forall v_j^E\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;n_1,\\ldots,n_k)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,k,n_k}\\cdots\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,n_1}(F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(\\nu_m^E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\nu_m^E,&amp;\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(v_j^E)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\nu_n^E&amp;j=i,\\\\v_j^E&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t&#39;)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t)&#39;,\\\\\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(s),\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,t))&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{rel}_E(\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(s),\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t))\\quad(\\operatorname{rel}\\in\\{\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{le}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\neg_E F)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F\\supset H)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)\\supset\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\forall v_j^E F)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v_j^E F&amp;j=i,\\\\\\forall v_j^E\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)&amp;j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;n_1,\\ldots,n_k)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,k,n_k}\\cdots\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,n_1}(F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>代入对象是闭数码，没有自由变量捕获，因而无需改变任何原绑定变量名；只在同名量词处停止递归。数码同时代入与上述顺序代入一致，且保留无指数子语言。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k\">\\(\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}\\)</span> 时为句子。</p>\n<p>这里严格沿用原书的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(n)\">\\(F(n)\\)</span> 字符串；Tarski 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F[n]\">\\(F[n]\\)</span> 是另外的量词包裹串，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6deaff22ee062525\" href=\"?note=6deaff22ee062525\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance\">92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance</a>，不是本函数的别名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-smullyan-free-variables","status":"resolved","id":"72f7b5109e33fa0f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-free-variables","status":"resolved","id":"72f7b5109e33fa0f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$i\\geq1,n\\in\\mathbb N$；$t,s\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E$，$F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E$，原书构造器与变量集见 [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance","status":"resolved","id":"6deaff22ee062525","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里严格沿用原书的 $F(n)$ 字符串；Tarski 的 $F[n]$ 是另外的量词包裹串，见 [[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]，不是本函数的别名。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"i\\geq1,n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"t,s\\in\\mathrm{Term}_E","display":false},{"tex":"F,H\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}smullyan\\text{-}numeral\\text{-}substitution}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(\\nu_m^E)&\\coloneqq\\nu_m^E,&\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(v_j^E)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\nu_n^E&j=i,\\\\v_j^E&j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t')&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t)',\\\\\n\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(s,t))&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{bin}_{E,j}(\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(s),\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\operatorname{rel}_E(s,t))&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{rel}_E(\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(s),\\operatorname{nt}_{E,i,n}(t))\\quad(\\operatorname{rel}\\in\\{\\operatorname{eq},\\operatorname{le}\\}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\neg_E F)&\\coloneqq\\neg_E\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F\\supset H)&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)\\supset\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(H),\\\\\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(\\forall v_j^E F)&\\coloneqq\n\\begin{cases}\\forall v_j^E F&j=i,\\\\\\forall v_j^E\\operatorname{nf}_{E,i,n}(F)&j\\ne i,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k(F;n_1,\\ldots,n_k)&\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{nf}_{E,k,n_k}\\cdots\\operatorname{nf}_{E,1,n_1}(F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Inst}_E^k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_E(F)\\subseteq\\{v_1^E,\\ldots,v_k^E\\}","display":false},{"tex":"F(n)","display":false},{"tex":"F[n]","display":false}],"bytes":2412,"backlinks":[{"id":"908bea5b0f15b61b","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2cf611da381080e0","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6511106aac2e96b7","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8ee662ea7161b3d7","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"725c1f1651ce9a00","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书先定义闭数码代入，随后定义变量改名；它的量词包裹 F[n] 刻意避免算术化一般代入。本文给更一般的 G 项代入。原书数码实例见 [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]；包裹见 [[92-df-smullyan-wrapped-instance]]。"},{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书语法与公理：[[92-df-smullyan-terms]] → [[92-df-smullyan-formulas]] → [[92-df-smullyan-free-variables]] → [[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]] → [[92-df-smullyan-truth]]。"},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-178","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-numeral-substitution]]"}],"outgoing":["72f7b5109e33fa0f","6deaff22ee062525"]}